/given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of bovine embryos in single in vitro production (sIVP) systems</article-title><source>Mol Reprod Dev</source><year>1998</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>147</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9740321</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1098-2795(199810)51:2&#x0003c;143::AID-MRD3&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-Q</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Leibfried-Rutledge</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors determining competence of in vitro produced cattle embryos</article-title><source>Theriogenology</source><year>1999</year><volume>51</volume><fpage>473</fpage><lpage>485</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10729106</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0093-691X(98)00241-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Machatkova</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Jokesova</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Horky</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Krepelova</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Utilization of the growth phase of the first follicular wave for bovine oocyte collection improves blastocyst production</article-title><source>Theriogenology</source><year>2000</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>543</fpage><lpage>550</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11071128</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0093-691X(00)00369-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hendriksen</surname><given-names>PJM</given-names></name><name><surname>Steenweg</surname><given-names>WNM</given-names></name><name><surname>Harkema</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Merton</s